   "source": [
    "**Insight:**\n",
    "- Hasil pemeriksaan menunjukkan adanya beberapa transaksi dengan `price` tinggi, dengan nilai maksimum sebesar **6.735** dan transaksi lainnya berada pada rentang **3.124–6.729**.\n",
    "- Nilai tinggi tidak hanya muncul pada satu transaksi, sehingga masih dapat merepresentasikan keberadaan produk dengan harga tinggi dalam dataset.\n",
    "- Data dengan `price` tinggi **tetap dipertahankan** karena tidak ditemukan indikasi bahwa nilai tersebut merupakan kesalahan pencatatan dan masih dapat merepresentasikan transaksi yang valid."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f523d786",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Simpan dataset main_csv"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 41,
   "id": "9050e391",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "order_payments_agg = payments.groupby('order_id')['payment_value'].sum().reset_index()\n",
    "\n",
    "main_data = orders.merge(\n",
    "    customers[['customer_id', 'customer_unique_id', 'customer_state']],\n",
    "    on='customer_id', how='inner'\n",
    ").merge(order_payments_agg, on='order_id', how='inner')\n",
    "\n",
    "main_data = main_data[[\n",
    "    'order_id', 'customer_id', 'customer_unique_id', 'customer_state',\n",
    "    'order_purchase_timestamp', 'order_delivered_customer_date',\n",
    "    'payment_value', 'order_status'\n",
    "]]\n",
    "\n",
    "main_data.to_csv('main_data.csv', index=False)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d4ee3f89",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8b831d89",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Explore Pertanyaan Bisnis 1: \n",
    "\n",
    "***\"Bagaimana segmentasi pelanggan berdasarkan Recency, Frequency, dan Monetary (RFM) pada periode 2017–2018, dan berapa persentase kontribusi segmen pelanggan terbaik terhadap total revenue pada periode tersebut?\"***"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 42,
   "id": "21db0d08",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Menjumlahkan total pembayaran setiap order berdasarkan order_id agar tidak terjadi duplikasi saat penggabungan data\n",
    "order_payments_agg = payments.groupby('order_id')['payment_value'].sum().reset_index()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 43,
   "id": "55fb27a1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Memilih transaksi yang terjadi selama periode 2017 hingga 2018\n",
    "orders_rfm = orders[(orders['order_purchase_timestamp'].dt.year >= 2017) & \n",
    "                    (orders['order_purchase_timestamp'].dt.year <= 2018)]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 44,
   "id": "84cc686c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Menggabungkan data order dengan identitas pelanggan dan total pembayaran setiap order\n",
    "rfm_df = orders_rfm.merge(customers[['customer_id', 'customer_unique_id']], on='customer_id', how='inner')\n",
    "rfm_df = rfm_df.merge(order_payments_agg, on='order_id', how='inner')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 45,
   "id": "fe723da8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Menghitung nilai Recency, Frequency, dan Monetary untuk setiap pelanggan\n",
    "recent_date = rfm_df['order_purchase_timestamp'].max()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 46,
   "id": "fd2a42bd",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "rfm_summary = rfm_df.groupby('customer_unique_id').agg({\n",
    "    'order_purchase_timestamp': lambda x: (recent_date - x.max()).days, # Menghitung jumlah hari sejak transaksi terakhir pelanggan (Recency)\n",
    "    'order_id': 'nunique',                                              # Menghitung jumlah transaksi yang dilakukan pelanggan (Frequency)\n",
    "    'payment_value': 'sum'                                              # Menghitung total nilai pembayaran pelanggan (Monetary)\n",
    "}).reset_index()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 47,
   "id": "bee60ca7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Mengubah nama kolom hasil perhitungan agar sesuai dengan konsep RFM\n",
    "rfm_summary.rename(columns={\n",
    "    'order_purchase_timestamp': 'Recency',\n",
    "    'order_id': 'Frequency',\n",
    "    'payment_value': 'Monetary'\n",
    "}, inplace=True)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 48,
   "id": "9fa96f02",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Membuat ranking untuk menentukan skor Recency, Frequency, dan Monetary setiap pelanggan\n",
    "rfm_summary['R_rank'] = rfm_summary['Recency'].rank(ascending=False)\n",
    "rfm_summary['F_rank'] = rfm_summary['Frequency'].rank(ascending=True, method='first') \n",
    "rfm_summary['M_rank'] = rfm_summary['Monetary'].rank(ascending=True)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 49,
   "id": "0e5eba7a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Membagi pelanggan ke dalam 4 kelompok berdasarkan ranking untuk menghasilkan skor 1 hingga 4\n",
    "rfm_summary['R_Score'] = pd.qcut(rfm_summary['R_rank'], 4, labels=[1, 2, 3, 4])\n",
    "rfm_summary['F_Score'] = pd.qcut(rfm_summary['F_rank'], 4, labels=[1, 2, 3, 4])\n",
    "rfm_summary['M_Score'] = pd.qcut(rfm_summary['M_rank'], 4, labels=[1, 2, 3, 4])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 50,
   "id": "53a90edb",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Menggabungkan skor Recency, Frequency, dan Monetary menjadi satu skor RFM\n",
    "rfm_summary['RFM_Score'] = (\n",
    "    rfm_summary['R_Score'].astype(str) +\n",
    "    rfm_summary['F_Score'].astype(str) +\n",
    "    rfm_summary['M_Score'].astype(str)\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Menghitung total revenue dari seluruh pelanggan\n",
    "total_revenue = rfm_summary['Monetary'].sum()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Mengelompokkan pelanggan berdasarkan segmentasi RFM dan menghitung revenue setiap segmen\n",
    "rfm_segment = rfm_summary.groupby('RFM_Score').agg(\n",
    "    Customer_Count=('customer_unique_id', 'count'),\n",
    "    Revenue=('Monetary', 'sum')\n",
    ").reset_index()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Menghitung persentase kontribusi revenue setiap segmen terhadap total revenue\n",
    "rfm_segment['Revenue_Contribution'] = (\n",
    "    rfm_segment['Revenue'] / total_revenue * 100\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Mengurutkan segmen berdasarkan revenue terbesar\n",
    "rfm_segment = rfm_segment.sort_values(\n",
    "    by='Revenue',\n",
    "    ascending=False\n",
    ").reset_index(drop=True)\n"
   ]
  },
